 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p>You function completely differently from normal creatures:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>You don’t need to eat, drink, breathe or sleep, but must remain inactive for 4 hours a day to gain the benefits of a long rest.   </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You have advantage on saving throws against disease and being poisoned, and you have resistance to poison damage.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You are immune to nonmagical bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You are invisible to creatures without cursed energy.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
